---
// Chapter 4: the same card styled with typical one-off fixes vs on the scale.
// Hand-written illustration of the patterns in the post, not captured model output.

const amounts = ['11,111.11', '8,888.88', '1,414.10'];
---
<figure class="atb">
  <div class="atb-grid">
    <div class="atb-col">
      <span class="atb-badge is-wrong">
        <span data-lang-en>One-off fixes</span>
        <span data-lang-vi>Vá từng chỗ</span>
      </span>
      <div class="atb-card">
        <div class="atb-head" style="align-items:center">
          <h4 style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.38">Invoice #1042</h4>
          <span style="font-size:13.5px">Oct 14</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="atb-nums" style="font-variant-numeric:proportional-nums;text-align:left">
          {amounts.map((a) => <li>{a}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <pre class="atb-code">{`text-[17px] leading-[1.38]
text-[13.5px]  items-center
text-left (default digits)`}</pre>
    </div>

    <div class="atb-col">
      <span class="atb-badge is-right">
        <span data-lang-en>On the scale</span>
        <span data-lang-vi>Nằm trong thang</span>
      </span>
      <div class="atb-card">
        <div class="atb-head" style="align-items:baseline">
          <h4 style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Invoice #1042</h4>
          <span style="font-size:14px">Oct 14</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="atb-nums" style="font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">
          {amounts.map((a) => <li>{a}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <pre class="atb-code">{`text-lg leading-tight
text-sm  items-baseline
text-right tabular-nums`}</pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Illustration, written by hand for this post: the left card collects the one-off values this post warns about; the right card uses only scale steps and the rules above. Same content, same width.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hình minh họa tự viết cho bài này: thẻ bên trái gom các giá trị vá tạm mà bài cảnh báo; thẻ bên phải chỉ dùng các bậc trong thang và các quy tắc ở trên. Cùng nội dung, cùng độ rộng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atb { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atb-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
  .atb-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .atb-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .atb-badge.is-wrong { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15); color: var(--red); }
  .atb-badge.is-right { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: var(--green, #10b981); }
  .atb-card { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; background: var(--bg-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; }
  .atb-head { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .atb-head h4 { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
  .atb-head span { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .atb-nums { list-style: none; margin: 12px 0 0; padding: 0; text-align: right; font-size: 16px; color: var(--text); }
  .atb-nums li { padding: 2px 0; }
  .atb-code { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; white-space: pre; overflow-x: auto; }
  .atb figcaption { margin-top: 0.8em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
